{"availability":"available","full":"rn-collins/aloha-suppression-sweep","name":"aloha-suppression-sweep","description":"A bounded, source-linked register of public platform-moderation evidence.","category":"Other","language":"HTML","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-06-02T07:05:37Z","updated":"2026-10-10T03:49:50Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://aloha-suppression-sweep.vercel.app","topics":["rn-collins","vercel"],"demo":"https://aloha-suppression-sweep.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:00.092Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:00.092Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:00.092Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T08:00:00.092Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A source-linked register of public records about how Meta has moderated drug-policy content. Every record states what its source establishes, what it does not, and — the field this register exists for — the specific wrong inference the record invites and why that inference fails.","The characteristic failure in this subject area is not fabricated evidence. It is real evidence stretched one step past what it can carry. The register holds counter-evidence on purpose: one adjudicated decision cuts against the suppression thesis, and it is published alongside the ones that support it.","One record cites a source that returned HTTP 404 with no archived copy. It is kept, marked, and stripped of evidentiary weight rather than deleted."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/rn-collins/aloha-suppression-sweep/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"963a3497d90dee577e5c0a24bf3356ce94b426a7a88c99881d7a956f943e504a","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:00.327Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T08:00:00.327Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A source-linked register of public records about how Meta has moderated drug-policy content. Every record states what its source est